      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the table, Nastya's mother brings up the awkward fact that Kostya punched her husband during their previous misunderstanding, prompting Nastya to make Kostya apologize on the spot. To end the family feud, Nastya invites her parents to visit their apartment for a vegetarian dinner.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
